SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Robert Kochka & Amanda Crowe
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, October 4th\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitato
 r Robert Kochka and Amanda Crowe\n\nIntention: Loop of Infinity\n\nHow man
 y parts have been buried\, composted\,\nAlchemized\, reclaimed?\nHow many 
 different\nMaidens\, mothers\, crones\nHave I been?\nA lifetime spirals ou
 t\nFrom every exhale\nA new beginning\nWith every inhale\nEach version of 
 myself\nA full circle\,\nCreating my fractal identity\nGobsmacked and\nDru
 nk on eternity\nAt the pinpoint of timelines\nCollapsing and expanding\nLi
 ke a star birthing a galaxy\nAn infinite loop of\nPast\, future\, and pres
 ent\nWrapped in\nEvery\nSingle\nMoment\nTime melting on my tongue\nIs an a
 lchemic elixir\nEvery second is a chance\nFor Transmutation\nPoem by Alia 
 Alsaif Spiers\nPainting: Amanda Crowe\n\n## About Robert Kochka and Amanda
  Crowe\n\nRobert Kochka’s amazing dance waves and DJ sets are known for 
 their fullness: bass\, feeling\, and energy! You’ll dance\, you’ll mov
 e\, you’ll feel new vibrations! Listen to his sets here: [https://soundc
 loud.com/robert-kochka-jr](https://soundcloud.com/robert-kochka-jr)\n\nAma
 nda Crowe sets and holds a wonderful container seeded with intention and b
 eauty.\n\nThis pair will lay out the carpet to welcome you more deeply int
 o yourself\, and perhaps into togetherness on the dance floor.\n\\~\\~\\~\
 n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close pr
 omptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Pleas
 e be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices:
  $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nP
 re-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Voluntee
 r and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunt
 eer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lk
 EDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3E
 LhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDo
 or will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTR
 Y AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollecti
 ve.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXN
 ydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LML
 wgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAshev
 ille Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all
  are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our miss
 ion and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free
 -form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformati
 on. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, A
 sheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
