SUMMARY:Let it Fall - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Stacey Butcher
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, October 9th\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGu
 est DJ Stacey Butcher/ Support Facilitator Megan Belling\n\nIntention: Let
  it Fall\n\nFall invites us into a different rhythm. The days grow shorter
 \, the air changes\, and the natural world begins to release what it no lo
 nger needs.\n\nWhat if we took a cue from the season?\n\nWhat are you read
 y to let fall away? What happens when you stop holding yourself together s
 o tightly? When you let your shoulders drop\, your breath deepen\, your bo
 dy soften\, and the music move you?\n\nThis Ecstatic Dance is an invitatio
 n to loosen your grip\, shake things loose\, and let yourself be moved. Th
 ere’s nothing you need to figure out or get right. Just bring your body\
 , your curiosity\, and a willingness to follow where the dance takes you.\
 n\nCome sweat. Come play. Come get a little wild. Come let it fall.\n\n## 
 About Stacey Butcher\n\nStacey Butcher is an Open Floor movement teacher\,
  serving on the faculty of Open Floor International\, and a Certified 5Rhy
 thms teacher (trained by Gabrielle Roth). She is also a Somatic Experienci
 ng Practitioner (SEP)\, Integral Somatic Psychology practitioner\, and a R
 eiki Master/Teacher. Stacey has been dedicated to the healing arts for ove
 r 25 years and has studied with healers and teachers from around the world
 . Her teaching is infused with passion\, deep presence and humor. She is a
 n inspirational facilitator and is skilled at holding space for transforma
 tion. For more info\, visit her website at http://www.staceybutcher.com/.\
 n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The d
 oors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turne
 d away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nT
 icket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack
  of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunte
 ers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollecti
 ve.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXN
 ydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LML
 wgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNC
 EMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please 
 note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\
 n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemov
 ementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTm
 Flam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71
 UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbou
 t AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harm
 ony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving commun
 ity. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community
  through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community
  transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 5
 0 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
