 or Kristikka (Kris Hostikka)\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Kristikka\n\nKr
 istikka loves creating a sacred container that takes you on an inward jour
 ney utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down in
 to stillness and integration. She feels that movement is medicine\, weavin
 g intention and a rich blend of world beats where it’s possible to be wi
 th what is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can fin
 d her dance mixes here:[ ](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka) [http://sou
 ndcloud.com/dj-kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka)\n\\~\\~\\~\n
 \n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close pro
 mptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please
  be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: 
